			"notes": "- Added Deadeye Skill system.\n\t- Set with /deadeye setskill command.\n\t- Level 0: Disable deadeye for the specified player.\n\t- Level 1: Auto marking, exit when shot manually.\n\t- Level 2: Manual marking, exit when shot manually.\n\t- Level 3: Manual marking, free manual shot. (Default)\n- Added Red Dead Redemption 1 Deadeye Style.\n\t- Deadeye Styles can be changed in the config.\n- Fixed a bug that forces the game to be at default tick speed constantly while not in deadeye."
		},
